{"seq":3,"slug":"project-references-and-build","title":"项目引用与构建流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/configuration-and-tooling/project-references-and-build","wordCount":1173,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目引用与构建流水线\">项目引用与构建流水线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当 TypeScript 项目规模增长到一定程度——特别是在 Monorepo 架构下——单一 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 已无法满足多包编译、增量构建和依赖隔离的需求。<strong>项目引用</strong>（Project References）是 TypeScript 提供的官方解决方案，它将大型代码库拆分为多个独立编译单元，配合 <code>tsc --build</code> 实现依赖感知的增量编译。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Monorepo&#10;        SHARED[&quot;packages/shared&lt;br/&gt;composite: true&quot;]&#10;        CORE[&quot;packages/core&lt;br/&gt;composite: true&quot;]&#10;        APP[&quot;packages/app&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SHARED --&gt; CORE&#10;    SHARED --&gt; APP&#10;    CORE --&gt; APP\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Monorepo\n        SHARED[\"packages/shared&lt;br/&gt;composite: true\"]\n        CORE[\"packages/core&lt;br/&gt;composite: true\"]\n        APP[\"packages/app\"]\n    end\n    SHARED --&gt; CORE\n    SHARED --&gt; APP\n    CORE --&gt; APP</pre><p>项目引用的核心价值：<strong>增量编译</strong>减少重复构建时间、<strong>依赖边界</strong>防止包之间的循环依赖、<strong>声明文件隔离</strong>确保每个包只暴露公共 API。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心配置项\">核心配置项</h2><h3 id=\"composite-选项\">composite 选项</h3><p><code>composite: true</code> 是项目引用的基础——被引用的项目必须开启此选项：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rootDir&quot;: &quot;./src&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src/**/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rootDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用 <code>composite</code> 后，TypeScript 会强制执行以下约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>declaration</code> 必须为 true</td>\n<td>必须生成声明文件供引用方使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必须设置 <code>rootDir</code></td>\n<td>确保输出目录结构可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有源文件必须被匹配</td>\n<td><code>include</code> 或 <code>files</code> 必须覆盖所有实现文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 文件</td>\n<td>记录构建状态，支持增量编译</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"references-选项\">references 选项</h3><p>在引用方的 tsconfig 中声明依赖关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rootDir&quot;: &quot;./src&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [{ &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../shared&quot; }, { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../core&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src/**/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rootDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../core\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>path</code> 指向被引用项目的目录（包含 <code>tsconfig.json</code>），或直接指向 tsconfig 文件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tsbuildinfofile\">tsBuildInfoFile</h3><p>增量编译的状态文件路径，默认与 <code>outDir</code> 中的 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 同名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;incremental&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;tsBuildInfoFile&quot;: &quot;./dist/.tsbuildinfo&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"incremental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tsBuildInfoFile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/.tsbuildinfo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 文件记录了上次编译的文件哈希和依赖关系，使 <code>tsc --build</code> 能够跳过未修改的项目。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见场景配置\">常见场景配置</h2><h3 id=\"tsc-build-模式\">tsc --build 模式</h3><p><code>tsc --build</code>（简写 <code>tsc -b</code>）是项目引用的专用构建命令，它与普通 <code>tsc</code> 的区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>tsc</code></th>\n<th><code>tsc --build</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译范围</td>\n<td>单个 tsconfig</td>\n<td>整个项目引用图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量编译</td>\n<td>需手动启用 incremental</td>\n<td>自动启用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖顺序</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n<td>按依赖拓扑排序编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳过未修改项目</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理产物</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td><code>tsc -b --clean</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BUILD[&quot;tsc --build&quot;] --&gt; ANALYZE[&quot;Analyze Project Reference Graph&quot;]&#10;    ANALYZE --&gt; TOPO[&quot;Topological Sort&quot;]&#10;    TOPO --&gt; CHECK_A[&quot;Check shared&lt;br/&gt;Needs Recompilation?&quot;]&#10;    CHECK_A --&gt;|&quot;Unmodified&quot;| SKIP_A[&quot;Skip ✅&quot;]&#10;    CHECK_A --&gt;|&quot;Modified&quot;| COMPILE_A[&quot;Compile shared&quot;]&#10;    COMPILE_A --&gt; CHECK_B[&quot;Check core&quot;]&#10;    SKIP_A --&gt; CHECK_B&#10;    CHECK_B --&gt;|&quot;Unmodified&quot;| SKIP_B[&quot;Skip ✅&quot;]&#10;    CHECK_B --&gt;|&quot;Modified&quot;| COMPILE_B[&quot;Compile core&quot;]&#10;    COMPILE_B --&gt; CHECK_C[&quot;Check app&quot;]&#10;    SKIP_B --&gt; CHECK_C&#10;    CHECK_C --&gt; COMPILE_C[&quot;Compile app&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    BUILD[\"tsc --build\"] --&gt; ANALYZE[\"Analyze Project Reference Graph\"]\n    ANALYZE --&gt; TOPO[\"Topological Sort\"]\n    TOPO --&gt; CHECK_A[\"Check shared&lt;br/&gt;Needs Recompilation?\"]\n    CHECK_A --&gt;|\"Unmodified\"| SKIP_A[\"Skip ✅\"]\n    CHECK_A --&gt;|\"Modified\"| COMPILE_A[\"Compile shared\"]\n    COMPILE_A --&gt; CHECK_B[\"Check core\"]\n    SKIP_A --&gt; CHECK_B\n    CHECK_B --&gt;|\"Unmodified\"| SKIP_B[\"Skip ✅\"]\n    CHECK_B --&gt;|\"Modified\"| COMPILE_B[\"Compile core\"]\n    COMPILE_B --&gt; CHECK_C[\"Check app\"]\n    SKIP_B --&gt; CHECK_C\n    CHECK_C --&gt; COMPILE_C[\"Compile app\"]</pre><p>常用命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"tsc --build&#10;&#10;tsc -b --verbose&#10;&#10;tsc -b --clean&#10;&#10;tsc -b --force&#10;&#10;tsc -b --watch\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --clean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --watch</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"monorepo-完整配置\">Monorepo 完整配置</h3><p>一个典型的 Monorepo 项目结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"monorepo/&#10;├── tsconfig.base.json&#10;├── tsconfig.json          # 根 solution 文件&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── shared/&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   │   ├── tsconfig.json&#10;│   │   └── package.json&#10;│   ├── core/&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   │   ├── tsconfig.json&#10;│   │   └── package.json&#10;│   └── app/&#10;│       ├── src/&#10;│       │   └── index.ts&#10;│       ├── tsconfig.json&#10;│       └── package.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>monorepo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tsconfig.base.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tsconfig.json          # 根 solution 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── shared/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── core/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── package.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>根目录 <code>tsconfig.base.json</code>（公共配置）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2022&quot;,&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;,&#10;    &quot;esModuleInterop&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;forceConsistentCasingInFileNames&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;sourceMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=